/**
 * AquaSentry Pro / Personal Tank Node - ESP32 Production Firmware
 * =====================================================================
 * System Architecture:
 * - Microcontroller: Espressif ESP32-WROOM-32 (Dual Core 240 MHz)
 * - FreeRTOS Dual-Core Architecture:
 *     * Core 0 (Telemetry Task): Wi-Fi, Web Server, Web OTA (/update), NVS Offline Buffer Sync
 *     * Core 1 (Measurement Task): High-precision ASV sweeps, ADS1115/MCP4725 DAC/ADC,
 *                                  A4988 Stepper Pump, Bubble Detection, AquaNet-V1 Edge AI
 *
 * Integrated Upgrades:
 * - Imp 7:  Electrochemical pre-cleaning pulse (+1.2V for 2.0s)
 * - Imp 8:  True Differential Voltammetry Mode (A0 - A1)
 * - Imp 11: FreeRTOS Dual-Core Task Segregation
 * - Imp 12: I2C 9-Pulse Bus Recovery Routine
 * - Imp 13: NVS Flash 500-Reading Circular Offline FIFO Buffer
 * - Imp 14: Web Browser Over-The-Air (OTA) Firmware Upload (/update)
 * - Imp 15: AquaNet-V3 trained edge classifier (float32, generated C99; V1 kept in aquanet_v1.c)
 * - Imp 26: Silicone Tubing Anti-Set Roller 1/4-Turn Reverse Relaxation
 * - Imp 27: Optical Dry-Run / Bubble Detection Safety Gate
 */

